@startuml
' Figure 7.4  Unknown outcome resolution by lookup
' Reading order: top to bottom, times are seconds from the first
' attempt. The ledger asks the airline at fixed offsets and stops at
' the airline's documented visibility bound.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
participant "Executor" as X <<ops>>
database "Effect ledger" as L <<evidence>>
participant "Airline" as A <<ops>>
X -> A : reissue(ref) at 0 s
A -[$FAIL]-> X : timeout at 8 s
X -> L : unknown
X -> A : lookup(ref) at 13 s
A --> X : not found
X -> A : lookup(ref) at 23 s
A --> X : ticket found
X -[$VERIFIED]-> L : committed
note over X, A : absent at the 40 s bound means\nit never landed: attempt again
@enduml
